From: Kennedy, Smith (Wireless Architect) <smith.kennedy@hp.com>
Date: Mon, Jul 18, 2016 at 3:35 PM
Subject: [PWG-Announce] Please fill out the travel survey for the PWG
August 2016 Face-to-Face Meeting - Camas, Washington
To: PWG Announcements Reflector <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Greetings,

The PWG is planning on holding a face-to-face meeting in August 2016,
hosted by Sharp Labs in Camas, WA. However, most respondents thus far have
said they plan to call in rather than attend in person.  If we don't
receive enough survey results by the end of this week indicating more are
planning on traveling, we will convert the meeting to a "virtual face to
face" meeting.

To that end, *please* visit the August 2016 event survey page ASAP (prior
to July 22, 2016) and indicate whether you plan to participate in person or
call in:

https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/KBRXD9S

The agenda and venue information can be found at:

http://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/august-2016-camas.html

This page will be updated with revised document links as the material
becomes available.

If you have already planned your travel or have other concerns, please
reply ASAP.

Cheers,

Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Wireless Architect - Client Software - IPG-PPS
    Standards - IEEE ISTO PWG / Bluetooth SIG / Wi-Fi Alliance / NFC Forum
/ USB IF
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
    HP Inc.
*/




